  Slug: the-brave
  DisplayName: The Brave
  IconPath: icons/skills/melee/maneuver-greatsword-yellow.webp
  Description: 'Your deeds show fearlessness: when a beast surfaces, you''re there
    to fight it; when someone''s lost in the dark, you''re first to the rescue. You''re
    trained in Athletics. After you Spark Transcendence, your body carries you forward,
    allowing you to Stride up to half your Speed in a straight line toward one enemy
    of your choice as a free action. Once you have used this ability on a given enemy,
    you can''t use it against that enemy again for 10 minutes.'
